The  driver handles a D.T. Software IDE interface plugged into an
Acorn expansion slot.  It uses the standard IDE  controller  dri‐
ver,  and  hence  can use the standard driver.  The card provides
two IDE channels.  The external IDE connector is channel 0, while
the internal connector is channel 1.  The driver was  derived  by
reverse‐engineering the card and its driver, so it may not handle
the card entirely optimally.
